Subject: No GPU renderer build of Hex's in kiln's copy
Why: Hex's shards-gpu entry names the files its scripts/shards-gpu/build.sh rebuilds Shards' GPU renderer from; Hex compiles none of them, kiln's copy takes none, and kiln carries no GPU VM process (docs/shards.md), so kiln's copy of Hex's manifest names no such copy of Shards.
Kiln-only: kiln's copy leaves out what only Hex's own scripts build

diff --git a/vendor/MANIFEST.toml b/vendor/MANIFEST.toml
index ac7a7b8d306ed09398a326608f384fe0c0b81fea..c292b92ee5fa80c55bdd7475fc7b46f27f3b592a 100644
--- a/vendor/MANIFEST.toml
+++ b/vendor/MANIFEST.toml
@@ -115,25 +115,6 @@ path = "vendor/shards"
 take = ["LICENSE", "AGENTS.md", "CLAUDE.md", "clippy.toml", "rustfmt.toml", "docs/development-rules.md", "docs/development-evidence.md", "crates/api", "crates/abi", "crates/afunix", "crates/testdir", "docs/research/measurements/managed-borrowed-nowait/focused.rs", "docs/research/measurements/managed-borrowed-nowait/contract.rs", "docs/research/measurements/managed-proc-main/allocation.rs", "docs/research/measurements/managed-proc-main/repro.rs", "docs/research/measurements/managed-proc-main/reader-tests.rs"]
 own = ["Cargo.toml", "UPSTREAM.md"]
 
-# Shards' renderer build (hyper-light): the `shards` binary whose GPU VM process renders a Shards GPU
-# guest's Venus on the host's driver (crates/hex-runtime/src/guest, SHARDS_BIN; AC-T7.4.1), at the same Shards
-# main as vendor/shards. Every change Hex carried at 0342b85d is upstream there (vendor/shards-gpu/UPSTREAM.md)
-# but one, kept as the recorded change: the GPU VM process built and carried for Windows on arm64, which
-# Shards' GPU lane holds (D232, "Held"). Hex compiles none of it: only the files that change touches are taken,
-# so `check` proves it applies to this commit, and scripts/shards-gpu/build.sh rebuilds `shards` from this
-# commit plus vendor/patches/shards-gpu. MIT, its LICENSE taken beside it.
-[projects.shards-gpu]
-kind = "git"
-repository = "https://github.com/hyper-light/shards"
-commit = "e82b9403b863718930fe9f224186d3ae862bfd61"
-path = "vendor/shards-gpu"
-take = [
-    "LICENSE",
-    "crates/shards/build.rs",
-    "scripts/gpu-libs",
-]
-own = ["UPSTREAM.md"]
-
